From 5a00660f01e9719a4715c47fd1b48c79ab5093a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noam Lessner <nlessner@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 17 Dec 2019 09:56:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-6739] arcboot: example firmware

add support for soc addressing
arcboot example for SPI DMA
arcboot_rom example for secureboot sdk

Change-Id: If94b52a9641477dafe19338dce4139a8ead3801a
Signed-off-by: Noam Lessner <nlessner@habana.ai>
